        <body>
            <div xml:id="d529">

                <pb facs="0561" n="395" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg395"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.00/1301</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-16T11:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 16, 1917—11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>General Guzman, member of Congress, prominent in 1906 revolution, political
                    companion Ferrara, and active inciting present troubles, surrendered today. He
                    took the field at outbreak of revolution, but lost all followers.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
